{
    "title": "OBDocker - OBD2 Car Scanner",
    "description": "Crafted with user-friendliness and power in mind, OBDocker is a professional OBD2 car scanner app that empowers you to diagnose, service, and customize your vehicles with ease and precision.\r\n\r\n\r\n*************************\r\nKEY FEATURES\r\n\r\n1\ufe0f\u20e3Triple-Mode Diagnostics\r\n\r\n\u25cb Full-Systems Diagnose: One-Click OE-Level full-systems diagnostics.\r\n\u25cb Multi-Systems Diagnose: Scan multiple systems through ECUs filtering such as TMS, SRS, ABS, TCM, BCM and many more.\r\n\u25cb Quick Scan: Swiftly read and clear engine fault codes to maintain a smooth drive.\r\n\r\n2\ufe0f\u20e3Triple-Mode Live Data\r\n\r\n\u25cb Health Monitor: Track every systems performance by diving into real-time parameters.\r\n\u25cb Engine Monitor: Monitor your engine's performance.\r\n\u25cb Dash Monitor: Visualize your vehicle's metrics in real-time.\r\n\r\n3\ufe0f\u20e3Full-Cycle Service\r\n\r\n\u25cb Emissions Pre-check: Test your emissions and pass with confidence before your official check.\r\n\u25cb Control Tests: Perform EVAP Leak Test, DPF and Inducement System Reinitialization.\r\n\u25cb Oil Reset: Easily reset oil change reminders and maintenance lights to keep your car's records up to date.\r\n\u25cb Battery Registration: Register the battery replacement to notify the battery management.\r\n\r\n4\ufe0f\u20e3On-Click Modification\r\n\r\n\u25cb Adjustments: Adjust different car settings and customize them by one-click.\r\n\u25cb Retrofits: Easily adapt additional vehicle parts after installation.\r\n\r\n\r\n*************************\r\nOBD ADAPTERS\r\nOBDocker requires a compatible OBD adapter to work. We recommend the following for the best experience:\r\n\r\n- High Performance: Vlinker Series, OBDLink Series, MotorSure OBD Tool, Carista EVO.\r\n- Middle Performance: All genuine adapters compatible with ELM327 / ELM329, including Veepeak Series, Vgate iCar Series, UniCarScan, NEXAS, Carista, Rodoil ScanX, and more.\r\n- Low Performance (Not Recommended): Cheep Chinese clones ELM.\r\n\r\n\r\n*************************\r\nSUPPORTED CARS\r\nOBDocker is compatible with a wide range of vehicles, covering both standard and advanced modes:\r\n\r\n- Standard Mode: Universal compatibility with OBD2 / OBD-II or EOBD vehicles worldwide.\r\n- Advanced Mode: Toyota, Lexus, Nissan, infiniti, Honda, Acura, Hyundai, Kia, Volkswagen, Audi, Skoda, SEAT, Mercedes-Benz, BMW, Mini, Porsche, Ford, Lincoln, Chevrolet, Cadillac, GMC, Buick. And still working really hard to add more\u2026\r\n\r\n\r\n*************************\r\nPLANS: \r\nOBDocker offers a free trial for full feature access. To unlock unlimited potential, choose from our Pro or Pro Max subscriptions.\r\n\r\nNOTE: \r\nVehicle ECUs vary in the amount of sensors supported. This app can\u2019t show you something, that is not provided by your car.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Crafted with user-friendliness and power in mind, OBDocker is a professional OBD2 car scanner app that empowers you to diagnose, service, and customize your vehicles with ease and precision.<br><br><br>*************************<br>KEY FEATURES<br><br>1\ufe0f\u20e3Triple-Mode Diagnostics<br><br>\u25cb Full-Systems Diagnose: One-Click OE-Level full-systems diagnostics.<br>\u25cb Multi-Systems Diagnose: Scan multiple systems through ECUs filtering such as TMS, SRS, ABS, TCM, BCM and many more.<br>\u25cb Quick Scan: Swiftly read and clear engine fault codes to maintain a smooth drive.<br><br>2\ufe0f\u20e3Triple-Mode Live Data<br><br>\u25cb Health Monitor: Track every systems performance by diving into real-time parameters.<br>\u25cb Engine Monitor: Monitor your engine&#39;s performance.<br>\u25cb Dash Monitor: Visualize your vehicle&#39;s metrics in real-time.<br><br>3\ufe0f\u20e3Full-Cycle Service<br><br>\u25cb Emissions Pre-check: Test your emissions and pass with confidence before your official check.<br>\u25cb Control Tests: Perform EVAP Leak Test, DPF and Inducement System Reinitialization.<br>\u25cb Oil Reset: Easily reset oil change reminders and maintenance lights to keep your car&#39;s records up to date.<br>\u25cb Battery Registration: Register the battery replacement to notify the battery management.<br><br>4\ufe0f\u20e3On-Click Modification<br><br>\u25cb Adjustments: Adjust different car settings and customize them by one-click.<br>\u25cb Retrofits: Easily adapt additional vehicle parts after installation.<br><br><br>*************************<br>OBD ADAPTERS<br>OBDocker requires a compatible OBD adapter to work. We recommend the following for the best experience:<br><br>- High Performance: Vlinker Series, OBDLink Series, MotorSure OBD Tool, Carista EVO.<br>- Middle Performance: All genuine adapters compatible with ELM327 / ELM329, including Veepeak Series, Vgate iCar Series, UniCarScan, NEXAS, Carista, Rodoil ScanX, and more.<br>- Low Performance (Not Recommended): Cheep Chinese clones ELM.<br><br><br>*************************<br>SUPPORTED CARS<br>OBDocker is compatible with a wide range of vehicles, covering both standard and advanced modes:<br><br>- Standard Mode: Universal compatibility with OBD2 / OBD-II or EOBD vehicles worldwide.<br>- Advanced Mode: Toyota, Lexus, Nissan, infiniti, Honda, Acura, Hyundai, Kia, Volkswagen, Audi, Skoda, SEAT, Mercedes-Benz, BMW, Mini, Porsche, Ford, Lincoln, Chevrolet, Cadillac, GMC, Buick. And still working really hard to add more\u2026<br><br><br>*************************<br>PLANS: <br>OBDocker offers a free trial for full feature access. To unlock unlimited potential, choose from our Pro or Pro Max subscriptions.<br><br>NOTE: <br>Vehicle ECUs vary in the amount of sensors supported. This app can\u2019t show you something, that is not provided by your car.",
